73904,"w":0.27620309829711914,"h":0.016684023798728465},{"text":"lived in tiny homes, such as caves, huts","y":0.29346938750239859,"x":0.046666670979293272,"w":0.30222221374511721,"h":0.01321665939019645},{"text":"and cabins. However, when homes","h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.044444450143771803,"w":0.30444442749023437,"y":0.30813953493433832},{"y":0.32408163288810599,"text":"became more permanent, bigger","x":0.046666678949327148,"w":0.30444442749023437,"h":0.013127669509576334},{"w":0.30444442749023437,"x":0.044444449115994045,"y":0.33866279058923632,"h":0.013173944122937264,"text":"started to be seen as better. Property"},{"text":"was in many ways a measure of wealth","x":0.046666666979293364,"y":0.35306122465197509,"h":0.013217845060387479,"w":0.30222221374511715},{"y":0.36717126518493992,"text":"and success. In the last decade or so,","h":0.013686730521065948,"x":0.044359948961625227,"w":0.30466991424560552},{"h":0.013128855958276953,"text":"however, people's priorities have begun","x":0.044444456727104974,"y":0.38367346973155647,"w":0.30444442749023443},{"text":"to change and there is a growing tiny","h":0.011836734693877471,"x":0.044444445660774788,"y":0.39959183681093835,"w":0.30222221374511721},{"y":0.41424418623278791,"w":0.30444444656372077,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"house movement. Tiny houses, as the","x":0.044444446429250738},{"h":0.011836734693877693,"y":0.43020408159618828,"w":0.30444442749023443,"x":0.044444456727104974,"text":"name suggests, are very small homes"},{"text":"and the reasons for choosing them are","w":0.30444442749023432,"x":0.044444452338216145,"h":0.013130042406977349,"y":0.44326530642965833},{"h":0.013200047551369165,"w":0.29555555343627926,"x":0.044444446642971404,"y":0.45918367370532476,"text":"as diverse as the buildings themselves."},{"y":0.4738372089213585,"w":0.27777776718139652,"h":0.013101566859653913,"x":0.071111111853746356,"text":"For some people, the choice is"},{"text":"purely financial, as they either can't","y"